{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"FeltEmbeddedCare"}],"title":"Felt Embedded Care iOS SDK","roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"abstract":[{"text":"Felt offers a seamless telehealth experience inside health apps. Our platform handles the full user lifecycle, including onboarding, payments, and doctor visits, ensuring a cohesive healthcare experience.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Initialization","type":"heading","text":"Initialization","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Primary interaction with the SDK is mediated through the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/EmbeddedCare\/shared","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" singleton."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"At app launch, initialize the SDK with your SDK key using ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/EmbeddedCare\/initialize(sdkKey:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"UIKit","level":3,"text":"UIKit","type":"heading"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import FeltEmbeddedCare","","let feltSDKKey = \"...\"","","class AppDelegate: UIApplicationDelegate {","    func application(_ application: UIApplication, didFinishLaunchingWithOptions launchOptions: [UIApplication.LaunchOptionsKey: Any]?) -> Bool {","        Task {","            do {","                try await EmbeddedCare.shared.initalize(sdkKey: feltSDKKey)","                \/\/ Update any UI waiting on embedded care initialization","            } catch {","                \/\/ Error will be thrown for invalid key","            }","        }","    }","}"]},{"type":"heading","text":"SwiftUI","anchor":"SwiftUI","level":3},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import FeltEmbeddedCare","","let feltSDKKey = \"...\"","","@main","struct ClientApp: App {","","    @State var embeddedCareInitialized = false","","    init() {","        Task {","            do {","                try await EmbeddedCare.shared.initialize(sdkKey: sdkKey)","                embeddedCareInitialized = true","            } catch {","                \/\/ Error will be thrown for invalid key","            }","        }","    }","","}"]},{"text":"User Account and Patient Details","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"User-Account-and-Patient-Details"},{"type":"heading","text":"Account","anchor":"Account","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Once your app’s current user has been authenticated, provide their account details to the SDK using ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EmbeddedCare\/account"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let user = ...","EmbeddedCare.shared.account = Account(id: user.id, email: user.email)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When the user logs out, inform the SDK by setting ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EmbeddedCare\/account"},{"text":" to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["EmbeddedCare.shared.account = nil"],"syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Selected Patient","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Selected-Patient"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK considers the logged in person currently using your app to be a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"patient"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Your user’s account may be the same person or a distinct person from the actual patient using your app."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For example, the account holder may be a parent and the patient may be their child."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Even if the account holder and patient represent the same person, take care to distinguish their ids"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"if your app’s data model keeps them distinct."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/Account\/selectedPatient","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" property to provide patient details to the SDK for the currently logged in patient."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let currentFamilyMember = ...","EmbeddedCare.shared.account?.selectedPatient = Patient(","    id: currentFamilyMember.id,","    relationshipToAccountHolder: .familyMember,","    email: currentFamilyMember.email,","    \/\/ Any custom information you want to provide","    custom: [\"notes\" : currentFamilyMember.notes]",")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If any information changes about the account or the selected patient, just update "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EmbeddedCare\/account"},{"type":"text","text":" with the latest information."}]},{"text":"Component Experiences","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Component-Experiences"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In order to integrate Felt embedded care content alongside your app’s native content, use "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/ComponentView","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIView"},{"type":"text","text":" subclass, or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/Component","isActive":true},{"text":", a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftUI"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"See the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/ComponentExperience","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enum"},{"type":"text","text":" for available options."}]},{"text":"UIKit","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"UIKit"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let componentView = ComponentView(experience: .dismissableCallToAction, custom: [:])","self.view.addSubview(componentView)","..."],"syntax":"swift"},{"text":"SwiftUI","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"SwiftUI"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct MyView: View {","    var body: some View {","        Component(experience: .dismissableCallToAction, custom: [:])","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Layout","anchor":"Layout"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Component contents may be loaded asynchronously, which means a component’s layout can change over time. A component determines its intrinsic height based on its current width."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIKit"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftUI"},{"text":" components provide the ability to specify an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onHeightUpdated"},{"text":" handler that allows you to react to intrinsic height changes. For example, you can use this handler to animate layout changes.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Full-Screen-Experiences","level":2,"text":"Full Screen Experiences","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Felt provides several full screen experiences you can explicitly present. See the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/FullScreenExperience","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"struct"},{"type":"text","text":" for available options."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["EmbeddedCare.shared.presentExperience(.splashScreen)"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"User interaction with components can automatically present full screen experiences."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Alternately, you can explicitly present full screen experiences using "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/FullScreenViewController"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/FullScreenView"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"text":"UIKit","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"UIKit"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let viewController = FullScreenViewController(experience: .pricingScreen)","viewController.modalPresentationStyle = .fullScreen","self.present(viewController, animated: true, completion: nil)","..."],"syntax":"swift"},{"text":"SwiftUI","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"SwiftUI"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["struct MyView: View {","","    @State var shouldPresentEmbeddedCare = false","","    var body: some View {","        MyViewContent($shouldPresentEmbeddedCare)","            .fullScreenCover(isPresented: $shouldPresentEmbeddedCare) {","                FullScreenView(experience: .splashScreen)","            }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK will automatically modally present full screen experiences in response to user actions such as tapping a component."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Feature Gating","anchor":"Feature-Gating"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can check if a feature is enabled for the current user by calling ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/EmbeddedCare\/checkFeatureGate(_:)"},{"text":". See the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/FeatureGate"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enum"},{"text":" for available options.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For example, before displaying a component, you should call ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/EmbeddedCare\/checkFeatureGate(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with the relevant feature gate to make sure the component should be displayed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["if EmbeddedCare.shared.checkFeatureGate(.globalRollout) {","    \/\/ View logic to display `ComponentView`","}"]},{"anchor":"Deep-Linking","level":2,"text":"Deep Linking","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK can handle certain deep-links to embedded care content through either urls or push notifications.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In your open-url and push notification handling code, call ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/EmbeddedCare\/handleURL(_:)"},{"text":"","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/EmbeddedCare\/handleNotification(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" respectively to give the SDK an opportunity to respond to a deep-link event. Use ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EmbeddedCare.shared.processStoredDeeplinks()"},{"text":" when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the UI is in a stable state, to ensure that the latest deep links are called.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Compatiblity","level":2,"text":"Compatiblity","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK has minimum version requirements of Swift 5.5 and iOS 15.","type":"text"}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"article","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/feltembeddedcare\/documentation"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]},{"paths":["\/documentation\/feltembeddedcare\/documentation"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/Documentation","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare/documentation/FeltEmbeddedCare/ComponentExperience":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An experience associated with a component view that is displayed alongside"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"your app’s native content"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/feltembeddedcare\/componentexperience","title":"ComponentExperience","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ComponentExperience","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/ComponentExperience","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ComponentExperience","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare/documentation/FeltEmbeddedCare/FeatureGate":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An enumeration of known features that can be checked for the current account"}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"FeatureGate","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"FeatureGate","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare\/documentation\/FeltEmbeddedCare\/FeatureGate","title":"FeatureGate","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/feltembeddedcare\/featuregate","type":"topic"},"doc://clinic.felt.EmbeddedCare/documentation/FeltEmbeddedCare/EmbeddedCare/handleNotification(_:)":{"type":"topic","abstract":[],"role":"sy